{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7866","id":5216516979,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABNu27cw","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7866","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7866.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7866.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7866","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7866/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7866/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7866/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/statuses/f4c7e2aa0b55f2ef248d44538a17619222992e2b","number":7866,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(backups): detect empty pm-stack day dirs (#3869)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n\nthe watchdog now checks the newest valid, fresh pm-stack day directory:\n\n```text\nif the dated directory is fresh\n  require pm-stack-<date>.tar.zst\n  otherwise report the date and missing path\n```\n\nThe check is read-only and skips when the pm-stack root is absent. Tests use a scratch HOME and cover absent root, an empty newest day despite an older archive, archive present, and stale-only directories.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- **Before:** the watchdog had no pm-stack day-directory check, so an empty recent directory could pass.\n- **After:** `bash nixos/home/laptop-backups-watchdog.test.sh` — all passed, including the missing/present/stale scenarios.\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** two-way — the watchdog check can be reverted independently.\n\n**Blast Radius:** low — read-only local backup validation; only emits a failure for a recent empty dated directory.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796774497&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7866&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7866&signature=ff70a7f0b75ec21414940d7723281bb0611701ff8a252998f98338d2212a05e8\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7866?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->","labels":[],"milestone":null,